    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "I always feel tired and sleepy. I sometimes sleepin class. I likemy teachers and I like all my subjects, butI don't get good marks. At night I can't sleep,so I go on the computer or watch TV. It'snot good.What should I do?",
        "bbox": [
